<sp who="#CAS"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Casperl</hi></speaker> <stage>(tritt ein.)</stage><lb/>
<p>Ah, <hi rendition="#aq">bon jour, bon jour,</hi> meine Herren!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#WALT"><speaker><hi rendition="#c"><hi rendition="#b">v. Walter.</hi></hi></speaker><lb/>
